sentences.t:
Ac, velut annoso validam cum robore quercum
Alpini Boreae nunc hinc nunc flatibus illinc
eruere inter se certant;

sentences.l:
And, as when a strong oak, with ancient timber,
the Alpine north winds, now from here, now with blasts from there,
to uproot among themselves strive;

sentences.t:
Haec se carminibus promittit solvere mentes
quas velit, ast aliis duras immittere curas,
sistere aquam fluviis, et vertere sidera retro;

sentences.l:
She herself by charms promises to release minds
which she wishes, but on others hard to send cares,
to halt the water in the rivers, and to turn the stars backward;
